[h1]Phobos Approach Assist (Prototype)[/h1]
[b]Version:[/b] 0.1.2
[b]Publication status:[/b] Not published - held historical prototype

Historical short-pulse navigation integration prototype retained as a development record. It is not the current Phobos Auto Nav mod.

[h2]Current features[/h2]
[list]
[*]A short test thrust pulse with prototype diagnostics and controls.
[/list]

[h2]Limits and save behaviour[/h2]
[list]
[*]Held historical prototype: not scheduled for Workshop publication.
[*]Not automatic approach or docking. Prototype actions are restricted to PhobosApproachAssistTest saves; this restriction does not apply to the current mod suite.
[*]Native placeholder artwork is referenced from the installed game; game images are not distributed here.
[/list]

[h2]Requirements and installation[/h2]
Historical build baseline: Ostranauts 1.0.1.4 and BepInEx 5. It is opt-in and excluded from the default installer.

This is a maintained pre-publication page draft, not a download announcement. No Workshop item has been published for this draft. Use the installation guide for source/prepared-package availability and loader setup. Do not remove required providers from saves that contain their content.

